@startuml UC-PRODUCT-GOAL-UPDATE
' UC-14.3 - Update Product Goal | semantic key: UC-PRODUCT-GOAL-UPDATE
' Source: data/use_cases/product-backlog/UC-PRODUCT-GOAL-UPDATE.yml
' Business Rules: BR-PRODUCT-ONE-GOAL, BR-PROJECT-ARCHIVED-READ-ONLY
' Trace comments ' [ref] name the YAML element behind the next action.
' No title: the Word caption supplies it.
' One Activity Final shared by all paths (team decision 2026-10-05; UML allows one or several). It
' is reached after the revised Product Goal is saved and recorded (postconditions met) or with the
' current Product Goal unchanged (EX-01 rejection, AF-01 cancellation).
' NF3 "revises the Product Goal and confirms the change" is drawn as the revision action followed
' by the actor's confirm/cancel decision, so AF-01 (cancel before saving) branches from it.
!include ../../_shared/activity-style.puml
|PRO| $lane_title("Product Owner")
|SYS| $lane_title("System")

|PRO|
start
' [NF1]
:Choose to edit
Product Goal;
|SYS|
' [NF2]
:Display current goal text;
|PRO|
' [NF3]
:Revise Product Goal;
if ($question("Confirm change?")) then ($guard_left("[confirm]"))
  ' [NF3]
  :Confirm change;
  |SYS|
  ' [NF4]
  :Validate revised Product Goal;
  if ($question("Still the Product Owner?")) then ($guard_left("[yes]"))
    ' [NF4, POST1, BR-PRODUCT-ONE-GOAL]
    :Save revised Product Goal;
    ' [POST2]
    :Record change in
    project activity history;
  else ($guard_right("[accountability", "lost — EX-01]"))
    ' [EX-01, BR-PRODUCT-ONE-GOAL, GUIDE-7.3]
    :Reject Product Goal revision;
  endif
else ($guard_right("[cancel before", "saving — AF-01]"))
  |SYS|
  ' [AF-01.1]
  :Keep current Product
  Goal unchanged;
endif
|PRO|
stop
@enduml
